  Magicbane gives magic resistance and absorbs 95% of curse attacks when
wielded.  It can also do a fair amount of damage in the right hands, and
doesn't stop a character from performing the most damaging attacks in
the game.  

  One of those attacks is throwing Expert daggers early and often, which
is the best way for an early to mid-game wizard to survive.  


  The best advice I can give an ambitious wizard is that it takes a lot
of character deaths to learn how to properly play wizards.




